## Professional Vocabulary
Define the important Week 1 terms in your own words.
Include terms such as:
- Virtualization  #The abstraction of computing resources so software-defined compute,storage, and networking can be created and managed
without direct control of the unerlying physical hardware.
- Finding     #Piece of information discovered through investigation/research.
- Assumption  #Statement accepted as true even though it lacks proof. 
- Escalation  #Passing an issue to a person with the authority, expertise, or acces needed when the current role should not make the change alone.
- Sandbox     #A controlled training enviroment with defined permissions, service limits, budget constraints, and operating boundaries. 
- Region      #Specific geographic area. 
- IAM  # Identity and Access Manaegment, framework of security policies and technologies that ensures the right users have the appropriate access.
- Operations Playbook #A structured professional record of tickets, evidence, analysis, reccomendations, escalation decisions, lessons learned, and technical vocabulary. 
